{
  "id": 10039440867645,
  "title": "Vive Focus Vision Wired Bundle - VR Headset with DisplayPort PC Streaming Kit",
  "handle": "vive-focus-vision-pc-vr-wired-bundle",
  "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">A 5K hybrid VR headset that works standalone or with PCVR, featuring built-in eye tracking, a hot-swappable battery, and full-body tracking support—completely base station-free. <meta charset=\"utf-8\">For the highest fidelity, connect in DisplayPort Mode. The VIVE Focus Vision Wired Bundle includes the headset, cable, and converter for a visually lossless connection.</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://shop-us.vive.com/pages/vive-focus-vision\" title=\"VIVE Focus Vision\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"> <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 179, 227);\">View product details and specs ›</span></strong></span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>VIVE Wired Streaming Kit enables DisplayPort mode for visually lossless, high-fidelity PC-VR streaming.</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">Helpful information</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">1. </span>PC VR content is accessible via VIVE Streaming within VIVE Hub on PC. VR‑ready PC required. VR headset and VR/MR titles each sold separately. Latency and visual quality of VR/MR content are dependent on PC specs, software settings, and network connection. <span class=\"a-text-bold\">Verify your PC meets the requirements for Streaming. Connect your computer directly to your Wi-Fi router using an Ethernet cable for PC VR streaming. </span>To connect to a PC via DisplayPort, VIVE Focus Vision also requires VIVE Wired Streaming Cable (DisplayPort mode compatible) and VIVE Wired Streaming Converter (DisplayPort mode compatible), both of which are included in VIVE Wired Streaming Kit (DisplayPort mode compatible).</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">2. </span>Content compatibility required. Please check the specifications to ensure the content supports eye tracking and related functions like foveated rendering. Performance may vary by title or application and may be affected by eye surgery, eye disease, heavy makeup, and/or high myopia.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">3. </span>Hand tracking features are VR title dependent. Check the VR title's description for compatible inputs or use a filtered search for hand tracking-enabled content.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">4. </span>The precision of the auto-IPD adjustment may vary from user to user.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">5. </span>Depth-sensing-enabled features are limited to indoor environments. Available virtual interactions using scene understanding are dependent on content compatibility.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">6. </span>The front internal battery is only intended to sustain power long enough for the rear battery to be swapped with a freshly charged VIVE Battery for Focus Series, and for no more than 20 minutes at a time. Please see the user guide for instructions on swapping the rear battery correctly.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">7.</span> VIVE Desk is accessible within VIVE Hub on PC. System requirements must be met. PC required. Visual quality of VR/MR content is dependent on PC specs, software settings, and network connection.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">8. </span>VIVE Ultimate Trackers sold separately. Content compatibility required.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">9. </span>MicroSD card not included.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">10. </span>Wi-Fi 6E support is country dependent. For more details visit manufacturer's support site.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">11. </span>120 Hz PC VR support via DisplayPort mode.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">12. </span>Glasses must be able to fit within the 150 mm wide facial interface, and the gasket spacer included in the box may need to be attached to the headset to provide sufficient depth. In some cases, the wide version of the gasket spacer may be needed. Availability varies by region.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">13. </span>All battery claim results will vary. Battery life and charge cycles vary by use.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\">14.</span> VIVE Wired Streaming Kit supports VIVE Focus Vision headset. System requirements must be met. VR‑ready PC required. VR headset and VR/MR titles each sold separately. Visual quality and low latency of VR/MR content is dependent on PC specs, software settings, and network connection.</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 179, 227);\"></span></strong></p>",
